<!--
  Jeeb wordmark as an Android VectorDrawable, ported from
  assets/brand/jeeb_logo.svg (Figma "Group 68" 56572:1821, viewBox 182x73.2418).

  This is the brand artwork the native cold-start splash draws. It exists so the
  Android 12+ SplashScreen icon and the pre-12 launch_background show the real
  "Jeeb" wordmark in white + orange — NOT the flat navy ic_launcher square that
  the SplashScreen API otherwise centres on the window (the actual root cause of
  the "plain navy square" splash). White/orange reads with full contrast on the
  navy splash background.

  Fill mapping mirrors the SVG: fill="white" -> jeeb_white, fill="#D73B00" ->
  jeeb_orange. Hairline cosmetic strokes and the sub-pixel mask glyph from the
  source SVG are omitted; the dominant letter fills carry the wordmark.
-->
